  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "09. Movement Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "09.02",
    "summary": "The active player works through their units singly until each has been selected to move. Each time, pick a friendly unit not yet selected this phase, whether it is on the battlefield, waiting in Strategic Reserves, or embarked in a TRANSPORT; then choose a move type it is eligible for and resolve it: Remain Stationary, Normal move, Advance move, Fall-back move, Disembark move, Ingress move, or one found elsewhere. Every unit, Strategic Reserves included, must be selected, even one that only Remains Stationary.",
